  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>99</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Let</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>23</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>22</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>23</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Total ordered pairs<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn></math></p><p>No ordered pair possible.</p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>71</mn></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>70</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>68</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>66</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>61</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>63</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>65</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>67</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>69</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Total&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>35</mn></math>&nbsp;ordered pairs.</p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>117</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>17</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>19</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>98</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>99</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Total&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>42</mn></math>&nbsp;ordered pairs.</p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>163</mn></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>63</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>65</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>63</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>99</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Total&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>19</mn></math>&nbsp;pairs.</p><p>No further case possible.</p><p>So,&nbsp;required number is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>42</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>108</mn></math></p>"
  }
